OL,3,GNEWSACouncil vows support for 'Toxic
OL,4,ATown' public inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader says he will support a
OL,7,Fpublic inquiry into contaminated land
OL,8,Fin a town, following a report published
OL,9,Flast week that revealed it could pose a
OL,10,Frisk to human health.
OL,12,FThe charity Earthwatch Europe says
OL,13,Ftrained citizen scientists have found
OL,14,Fpotentially harmful levels of metal or
OL,15,Fmetalloid at 52 freshwater sites across
OL,16,FCorby.
OL,18,FChildren in Corby have been born with
OL,19,Fbirth defects, believed to have been
OL,20,Fcaused when steelworks were demolished
OL,21,Fin the 1980s.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
