OL,3,GNEWSACouncil vows support for 'Toxic
OL,4,ATown' public inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs first reported in the NN Journal,
OL,7,FMartin Griffiths, Reform-UK Leader of
OL,8,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said:
OL,9,F"We have nothing to hide."
